{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21843","headline":"古决絶词 二 · 元稹","name":"古决絶词 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"噫春冰之将泮，何予怀之独结。\n有美一人，於焉旷绝。\n一日不见，比一日於三年。\n况三年之旷别，水得风兮小而已波。\n笋在苞兮高不见节，矧桃李之当春。\n竞衆人而攀折，我自顾悠悠而若云。\n又安能保君皑皑之如雪，感破镜之分明，覩泪痕之余血。\n幸他人之既不我先，又安能使他人之终不我夺？\n已焉哉！织女别黄姑，一年一度暂相见，彼此隔河何事无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21843.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21843","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}